OL,3,GNEWSAVeterans describe 'struggle' after
OL,4,Aleaving forces                         
OL,6,FA former RAF serviceman says he still  
OL,7,Fstruggles with simple decisions such as
OL,8,Fwhat to wear nearly 30 years after     
OL,9,Fleaving the armed forces.              
OL,11,FGeoff Wood left the RAF in 1997 after  
OL,12,F28 years' service and said civilian    
OL,13,Flife could be challenging because "all 
OL,14,Fthe decisions that you make in life are
OL,15,Fyours, and that includes what you are  
OL,16,Fgoing to wear that day; I still find   
OL,17,Fthat difficult."                       
OL,19,FWood, from Lincolnshire, now helps     
OL,20,Fservice personnel make the transition  
OL,21,Fto civilian life as a mentor volunteer 
OL,22,Ffor SSAFA, the Armed Forces charity.   
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
